    <status>Draft</status>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>ackBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hello,

Thank you for contacting BirdLife Australia. Your enquiry has been received and logged as case {!$Record.CaseNumber}.

Our Supporter Care team works through enquiries in the order they arrive and will be in touch as soon as possible. If you need to add anything, simply reply to this email and it will be attached to your case.

Warm regards,
BirdLife Australia Supporter Care</text>
    </textTemplates>
